<section class="narrow page-head"><span class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</span><h1>Privacy information – draft</h1><p>This page is a placeholder and must be reviewed and completed by an Indian privacy professional before public launch.</p><h3>Information we may collect</h3><p>Account details and information you voluntarily provide in a meal-planning assessment, such as food preferences, measurements, allergies and relevant health-related considerations.</p><h3>Why we use it</h3><p>To create and manage your account, assess service suitability, provide the service you request, communicate about your order and meet legal obligations.</p><h3>Sharing and processors</h3><p>Where enabled, service providers such as hosting, payment, AI and messaging providers may process information to deliver the service. Appropriate contracts, safeguards and disclosures must be in place before these integrations are activated.</p><h3>Your choices</h3><p>Contact the service operator to request access, correction, withdrawal of consent or deletion where applicable. Marketing consent must be optional and separate from service consent.</p><p><strong>Operator contact:</strong> Configure the legal entity name and a monitored privacy contact email before launch.</p></section>